  "summary": "GO2 Health, a medical clinic in Brisbane, Australia, had one internal email mailbox taken over in a business email compromise phishing attack; it alerted mailbox users who received the phishing email on April 24, 2026. The mailbox auto-archived 12 months of email, including some patients' Department of Veterans' Affairs ID numbers. The clinic's main patient system was not accessed. Patients were told almost three months later, and the ABC reported it on July 21, 2026.",
